  "contentHtml": "<p>#온난전선 #한랭전선</p><p>&#160;</p><p>입체로 만드는 전선학습지입니다.</p><p>너무 오래 전에 만든 자료인데, ^^;; 검색해보니 자료가 사라졌길래 다시 올려봅니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/03011a9ac563d3bec7cb2345635bb987e4610c15?download\" data-file-name=\"입체로 전선만들기.hwp\" data-file-size=\"408064\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D610%26fileid%3D13%26regdt%3D20210428113702&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F03011a9ac563d3bec7cb2345635bb987e4610c15')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">입체로 전선만들기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">398.50KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 만들기 종이는 이렇습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b4968d09bffe0b728bb5436a0a45a732d54fbd7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b4968d09bffe0b728bb5436a0a45a732d54fbd7\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 실선은 모두 칼질로 자릅니다. (노란 형광펜)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0fabd27e1eb5e8cf48b8d8b0f28da80adc17afe7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0fabd27e1eb5e8cf48b8d8b0f28da80adc17afe7\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 어두운 면은 이렇게 나오게 접을꺼예요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bce88260b92ce9817b255f75bca1ca19dab89ce5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bce88260b92ce9817b255f75bca1ca19dab89ce5\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>4. 산접기(나오게 접는 선) 는 딱 2군데입니다. (빨간 형광펜)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f314d651ffb33c240300f48d08697382547bc8cd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f314d651ffb33c240300f48d08697382547bc8cd\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>5. 나머지 점선은 모두 들어가게 접으면, 끝!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ffe1d8ea15f3c9cf4ffaa9e2635678feddc5e18\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ffe1d8ea15f3c9cf4ffaa9e2635678feddc5e18\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>6. 찬따찬! 공기의 위치를 기록합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bacb103393079282f69eee51ab8ab6e2c211545e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bacb103393079282f69eee51ab8ab6e2c211545e\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>7. 바닥면에 전선도 그려주고, 바닥에도 찬따찬 공기를 기록합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b53680651771395bcf77c11646ce5759b11bc621\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b53680651771395bcf77c11646ce5759b11bc621\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>8. 공기 상승으로 만들어지는 구름을 그려봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fb39b5da5e3cfdb57feda4cb3c26ba67a06f200\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fb39b5da5e3cfdb57feda4cb3c26ba67a06f200\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>9. 구름에서 오는 비의 위치, 구역, 형태를 기록합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8416240158f3f57338459705c67c7fa39d0eb302\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8416240158f3f57338459705c67c7fa39d0eb302\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>10. 아래 표까지 완성하면 전선 끝!!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a27ad8c99ae550464098d626de5f0d5ef32b9ea\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a27ad8c99ae550464098d626de5f0d5ef32b9ea\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a0a43041574d8c7a911e3095d7479ebcd9a7fc2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a0a43041574d8c7a911e3095d7479ebcd9a7fc2\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/624967d5ba87c653976c250d4b9e700cdd95d72f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/624967d5ba87c653976c250d4b9e700cdd95d72f\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
